gopmgr (1.1.0+git20260804~ppa1~ubuntu26.10.1) stonking; urgency=medium

  * Renamed the source and binary package from pmforge to gopmgr — the
    project itself was renamed from PMForge to GoPMgr to avoid confusion
    with the unrelated online PM simulation platform at getpmforge.com.
  * No functional change: the on-disk data directory, project file
    extension (.pmforge), and backup archive entry names are unchanged
    for compatibility with existing installs.

